# FILE:      .gitignore
# CREATED:   2026-10-20 13:27 +03
# TASK:      596
# AUTHOR:    kwtSMS
# WHAT:      Paths that must never be committed to the kwtSMS CS-Cart add-on repository.
# WHY:       The repo will be public. Planning docs, local tooling, test harnesses that hold
#            real API credentials, and the Docker dev stack stay on the developer machine.
# USAGE:     Read by git automatically.
# DEPENDS:   Nothing.

# Local planning, research and screenshots (required by docs/prompt.md)
docs/

# Integration tests: they call the live kwtSMS API with test=1 and read credentials from .env
tests/

# Local dev environment. Required by docs/prompt.md. The dev stack is a dedicated WSL2 instance,
# not Docker (Boss, 2026-10-20 13:28 +03); these lines only guard against stray files.
docker/
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.yml

# Assistant and session tooling
.claude/
claude.md
CLAUDE.md
napkin.md
.remember/
.worktrees/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Logs and caches
*.log
.phpunit.result.cache
.php-cs-fixer.cache
.phpcs-cache

# Dependencies (the add-on ships without Composer dependencies)
vendor/
node_modules/

# Build output (marketplace packages are built, never committed)
dist/
build/
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

# IDE and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
